WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:07.218
Templates give you a head start on the documents every small business needs. In this video, you’ll pick one and use it.

2
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:16.075
Open Templates, under Spaces. There are 38, in nine categories, from operations and safety to marketing and finance.

3
00:00:17.107 --> 00:00:24.467
Open one to see it. Its sections come out as numbered, colored cards, here, in the editor, and in every page made from it.

4
00:00:25.511 --> 00:00:31.250
Click Use Template to start a page from it, or New, to save your own company’s templates for everyone.

5
00:00:32.285 --> 00:00:34.994
That’s Templates. Next, the Knowledge Library.

